<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>DevAI Studio · design gallery revision 4</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#F2EDE5;color:#20352D;font:16px/1.6 system-ui}header{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:36px 28px}h1{font:500 42px/1.18 Georgia,serif;margin:16px 0}h2{font:500 26px/1.3 Georgia,serif;margin:4px 0}header p{max-width:880px;color:#615E57}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;color:#615E57;letter-spacing:.04em}.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#173D32;font-weight:650}.brand span{background:#173D32;color:#FAF7F2;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:10px}.facts{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.facts span{background:#E8E0D5;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:99px}.toolbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;background:#E8E0D5;padding:18px 28px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid #CFC6BA}.toolbar label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:14px;gap:4px}select,input,button{font:16px system-ui;min-height:48px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #82786B;border-radius:12px;background:#FAF7F2;color:#20352D}select{max-width:380px}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}figure{margin:0;background:#FAF7F2;border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #20352d11}figcaption p{color:#615E57;margin:8px 0 20px}img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}figure[data-platform=ios] img{width:390px;max-width:100%;margin:auto}.image-button{display:block;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;min-height:0;width:100%;cursor:zoom-in}.image-button img{border-radius:12px}figure[hidden]{display:none}a{color:#173D32}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #245646;outline-offset:3px}#count{align-self:end;padding:12px 0;font-size:14px}dialog{background:#FAF7F2;border:0;border-radius:20px;padding:20px;max-width:96vw;max-height:96vh;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#20352dbb}dialog button{position:sticky;top:0;display:block;margin:0 0 16px auto}dialog img{max-width:90vw;width:auto}footer{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:28px;color:#615E57}@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:24px 18px}h1{font-size:34px}.toolbar{position:static;padding:18px}.toolbar label{width:100%}select,input{width:100%;max-width:none}main{padding:14px}figure{padding:14px}h2{font-size:24px}}</style></head><body><header><div class="brand"><span>✦</span>DevAI Studio</div><h1>A warmer, more expressive studio.</h1><p>Browse the revised desktop and native iOS designs. The warm editorial system now extends through research, editors, review, publishing, settings, dialogs and recovery.</p><div class="facts"><span>59 screen contracts</span><span>359 interaction contracts</span><span>253 visual artifacts</span><span>25 native continuation views</span></div><p>Choose a screen below, then click a design to inspect it at full size. Build designs are the default; older AI-generated mockups are available under Style references. Artwork and research data are illustrative fixtures.</p></header><div class="toolbar"><label>Screen<select id="screen"><option value="all">All screens and dialogs</option><option value="AUTH-01">AUTH-01 · Welcome &amp; sign in</option><option value="AUTH-02">AUTH-02 · Check your email</option><option value="ONB-01">ONB-01 · Set up your studio</option><option value="HOME-01" selected>HOME-01 · Home</option><option value="DISC-01">DISC-01 · Discover</option><option value="QUEUE-01">QUEUE-01 · Editorial queue</option><option value="TOPIC-01">TOPIC-01 · Topic overview</option><option value="SOURCE-01">SOURCE-01 · Evidence &amp; sources</option><option value="CLAIM-01">CLAIM-01 · Claims &amp; grounding</option><option value="IMPORT-01">IMPORT-01 · Add a topic</option><option value="CREATE-01">CREATE-01 · Choose format</option><option value="CREATE-02">CREATE-02 · Creative d